Changes by Suite Utils from the original: cache-first lookups (nsx) instead of calling catalog
tools every time; large results kept out of context; count -> aggregate -> detail escalation;
ROWNUM replaced by ORDER BY ... FETCH FIRST (the original put it next to GROUP BY/ORDER BY, which
truncates before aggregating/sorting, and an outer ROWNUM gives the same wrong result on NetSuite,
live-verified 2026-09-27); recordtype vs type values corrected; approvalstatus only where the
account populates it; budget-vs-actual fan-out fixed; GL, multi-subsidiary and budget
templates grouped per subsidiary (base currencies differ) with a primary-book filter; AR aging
handles missing due dates and credit memos; sequential
calls; Source line; removed "show your reasoning throughout", the artifact-at-10-rows rule and the
confirm-before-any-SuiteQL rule (read-only SuiteQL is checked by the su-ns-harness guard).

